# INVWINEF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the most rows a
# choice of all holds, KS_MAXROWS of SRC/CLIENT/KEYSET.H, on the seed's
# three items and the 4094 of INVWIN_WINSEEDEF, one too many.  CTRL-/,
# with three rows chosen, is refused in a message box naming the most,
# the three still chosen after it.  With the last item deleted,
# CTRL-/ chooses all 4096, and END shows the last page's rows selected.
# The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEF.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S OPEN
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN CTRL-SLASH
S OVER
K ENTER
S OVERBK
K END DEL Y
S ONELESS
K CTRL-SLASH
S CAP
K END
S CAPEND
K ALT-F X
